OL,6,
OL,7,FThat followed comments from
OL,8,FVice-President JD Vance, who said
OL,9,F"everyone knows" the war was why his
OL,10,Fparty lost
OL,12,FMeanwhile, oil prices have fallen to
OL,13,Ftheir lowest level in two months in the
OL,14,Fwake of the result
